=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Naji (A)} at (J-5), southeast of Verdicial Conflux #08 to begin the quest.
** You will handover the {@k} {k:Naji's linkpearl} obtained at the end of the last quest.
* You must procure a {i:Gauger Plate|Gauger Plate|2480} of one of the following NMs in {z:Abyssea - Konschtat}:
** {m:Kukulkan}, {m:Turul}, {m:Fistule}, {m:Bloodeye Vileberry}, {m:Eccentric Eve}, {m:Depths Digester} are confirmed to work. More NMs might be eligible.
*** Your image should be taken at close range, and facing the NM to qualify. **It is recommended to take multiple in case one doesn't turn out.**
*** You do not need to have claim on the monster in order to get a picture that qualifies.
* Return to {p:Naji (A)} and trade one of your acceptable {i:Gauger Plates|Gauger Plate|2480} to complete the quest.

__This quest can only be completed **once per Vana'diel day.**__
